                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Simple yet stunning. There is something so eerie and melancholic about this game that it stuck in my head for days,  I could not stop thinking about it. I even found myself wondering what I would do if I were dropped into that world in real life, which is something very, very few games have ever made me ponder. No killing or shooting. No monsters or violence. Just a mystery and a lot of interesting puzzles. Give your battle-weary brain a change of pace and take a break from FPSs. See if you're smart enough to find your way to the end of Kairo.",
